1
00:00:52,640 --> 00:00:54,159
Zhang Tianyou!

2
00:00:54,679 --> 00:00:57,159
Tonight, I'm taking your miserable life!

3
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:07,480
Young Master.

4
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:09,959
The thing in this coffin won't come out, right?

5
00:01:10,239 --> 00:01:11,799
The Yin energy is surging,

6
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:13,239
making the corpse restless.

7
00:01:14,040 --> 00:01:16,799
This thing is incredibly dangerous.

8
00:01:17,599 --> 00:01:18,400
Tianyou.

9
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:21,480
Listen.

10
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:25,280
Aren't the sounds from this coffin a bit too crisp?

11
00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:45,480
Zhang Tianyou.

12
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:48,000
Instead of hugging your pillow in the middle of the night,

13
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,920
you're massaging a coffin lid here?

14
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:51,680
Shu, cover me!

15
00:01:52,879 --> 00:01:54,879
Cousin, why are you here?

16
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:55,920
Ling Yu.

17
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:58,519
Today, I'll help your Sheng Family

18
00:01:59,519 --> 00:02:01,079
clean house!

19
00:02:01,319 --> 00:02:01,959
Cousin!

20
00:02:01,959 --> 00:02:02,719
Get him!

21
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:11,439
Ling Yu...

22
00:02:12,039 --> 00:02:15,000
you look so beautiful in the candlelight.

23
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:39,000
Go, go, go!

24
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,240
Hurry up! Stop looking!

25
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:45,560
It's a ghost!

26
00:02:54,039 --> 00:02:56,439
Help!

27
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:59,159
Save me!

28
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:01,759
Help!

29
00:03:03,599 --> 00:03:05,599
Save me!

30
00:03:06,639 --> 00:03:07,800
The Eldest Young Master is still there!

31
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:08,759
Save me!

32
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:11,080
Go!

33
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,039
Save me!

34
00:03:35,199 --> 00:03:36,639
Give me a hand!

35
00:03:38,639 --> 00:03:39,439
Cousin!

36
00:03:39,879 --> 00:03:40,759
Careful.

37
00:03:40,759 --> 00:03:42,199
Fill up the hole!

38
00:03:42,759 --> 00:03:44,120
Aren't your two men still inside?

39
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:44,639
Fill what up?

40
00:03:44,639 --> 00:03:46,080
Didn't you see how terrifying that monster was?

41
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:47,520
I didn't even have time to use my talisman!

42
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:49,319
Stop playing saint at a time like this!

43
00:03:49,319 --> 00:03:51,240
Fine! If you want to fill it, do it yourself.

44
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,599
I'm not doing something so heartless!

45
00:03:52,759 --> 00:03:53,199
Hey!

46
00:03:53,199 --> 00:03:54,840
Stop arguing, stop arguing!

47
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:56,319
You... figure it out yourself.

48
00:03:56,319 --> 00:03:57,120
I'm going back to my room.

49
00:04:15,919 --> 00:04:16,800
Second Young Master.

50
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:18,360
How was our acting just now?

51
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:19,639
Not bad.

52
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:22,360
Good thing I figured out early on

53
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:24,199
the secrets buried beneath the Sheng Family.

54
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:26,600
Tell me,

55
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:28,160
how did your Second Young Master do

56
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:30,519
in that little tomb scare performance?

57
00:04:30,519 --> 00:04:32,560
Vocals, lines, movement, and expression were spot on!

58
00:04:33,199 --> 00:04:34,680
That's our Second Young Master for you.

59
00:04:35,279 --> 00:04:36,839
What's acting all about?

60
00:04:36,839 --> 00:04:37,839
Pacing.

61
00:04:38,079 --> 00:04:39,079
Nuance.

62
00:04:46,439 --> 00:04:48,839
Since I coated his legs in Bone-Corroding Powder,

63
00:04:49,319 --> 00:04:50,519
in less than three days,

64
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:53,800
his legs will be completely ruined.

65
00:04:58,240 --> 00:05:01,319
There are 16 days left until The Four Great Families' fated deadline.

66
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:03,800
Zhang Tianyou.

67
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,680
Given your methods and your words,

68
00:05:06,199 --> 00:05:08,199
you can't be just a common Rogue Earthworker.

69
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:09,879
Who exactly are you?

70
00:05:14,639 --> 00:05:16,920
Who I am isn't important.

71
00:05:18,759 --> 00:05:21,360
When the Sheng Family chose me as their son-in-law,

72
00:05:21,439 --> 00:05:24,120
it was only because my birth chart showed a Pure Yin Birth Time.

73
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:25,079
My fate is tough enough.

74
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:29,319
You wanted me on the Sheng Family's journey to the Tide Tomb

75
00:05:29,319 --> 00:05:30,519
to act as a shield against disasters.

76
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:37,000
But right now, the Sheng Family is a sinking ship.

77
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:41,240
If you want to survive,

78
00:05:42,199 --> 00:05:43,759
help me stabilize the Sheng Family.

79
00:05:44,399 --> 00:05:45,639
All I can do

80
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,680
is make sure that in the coming storm,

81
00:05:48,839 --> 00:05:50,360
you don't end up drowning.

82
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:18,920
Chief Leng.

83
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:20,839
Long time no see.

84
00:06:22,199 --> 00:06:23,759
What kind of wind

85
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:26,360
blew a big shot like the head of the Qi Family

86
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:28,160
into my humble little temple?

87
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:31,120
I'm here to make a deal with you, Chief Leng.

88
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:34,199
As long as you help me take out one person,

89
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:36,319
our Qi Family

90
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:40,759
is willing to give you a few more lucrative old pits.

91
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:42,120
What do you say?

92
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,839
Whose life is so valuable?

93
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:47,279
The Sheng Family's live-in son-in-law,

94
00:06:47,839 --> 00:06:49,639
Zhang Tianyou.

95
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:13,839
Some blind fool...

96
00:07:13,839 --> 00:07:15,199
...paid to put you to rest.

97
00:07:17,279 --> 00:07:18,120
Who are you?

98
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:19,360
For your trouble.

99
00:07:19,839 --> 00:07:21,160
Go sleep in the next room.

100
00:07:21,759 --> 00:07:22,920
I need to inspect the goods.

101
00:07:24,759 --> 00:07:25,639
Be careful.

102
00:07:29,399 --> 00:07:33,160
Ready to die a happy man?

103
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:49,439
You have an extraordinary build.

104
00:07:49,439 --> 00:07:50,920
You don't look like you'd die young.

105
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:52,879
The gleam in your eyes...

106
00:07:53,399 --> 00:07:55,439
...shines brighter than the luminous pearls in a tomb.

107
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:58,040
No wonder people can't rest easy.

108
00:07:58,040 --> 00:08:00,759
There's a scent on you.

109
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:03,199
It's quite peculiar.

110
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:06,680
You raid tombs often, don't you?

111
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,160
Don't worry.

112
00:08:08,839 --> 00:08:10,120
After you're gone...

113
00:08:10,519 --> 00:08:12,600
I'll still visit you often.

114
00:08:25,439 --> 00:08:27,360
If you really wanted to kill me,

115
00:08:27,439 --> 00:08:30,399
you wouldn't have tiptoed into my room.

116
00:08:30,839 --> 00:08:33,519
You've got a sharp mind.

117
00:08:33,919 --> 00:08:36,320
And you're not bad to look at, either.

118
00:08:36,879 --> 00:08:38,399
It'd be a shame if you died.

119
00:08:44,919 --> 00:08:47,159
Tell me. Who sent you?

120
00:08:47,159 --> 00:08:49,519
The one who wants you dead didn't want to come personally,

121
00:08:49,519 --> 00:08:50,679
so they sent me instead.

122
00:08:51,399 --> 00:08:52,600
Who do you think it is?

123
00:08:57,759 --> 00:08:59,120
Judging by your looks,

124
00:08:59,519 --> 00:09:02,120
you're not from The Four Great Families.

125
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:03,120
Miss,

126
00:09:03,679 --> 00:09:06,480
the corpse poison in you has built up for years.

127
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:08,679
It's already seeped into your bones.

128
00:09:09,279 --> 00:09:10,639
You only have a few days left to live.

129
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:14,720
Why don't we make a deal?

130
00:09:17,399 --> 00:09:19,039
What do you have to trade with me?

131
00:09:19,039 --> 00:09:22,039
I can help you purge all the corpse poison in your body.

132
00:09:22,039 --> 00:09:25,759
And I'll also give your brothers in the Sand-Turning Gang

133
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:27,960
a large piece of territory.

134
00:09:28,279 --> 00:09:29,360
And your conditions?

135
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:30,159
Very simple.

136
00:09:30,639 --> 00:09:33,039
I need you to help me find a tomb.

137
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:35,240
It holds the Qi Family's original talisman manuscript.

138
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:36,679
Before the next full moon,

139
00:09:36,679 --> 00:09:39,480
I need The Four Great Families' talismans and seal eyes,

140
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:40,759
the four great magical artifacts.

141
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:43,519
It seems you

142
00:09:44,039 --> 00:09:46,279
are more than just a simple live-in son-in-law.

143
00:09:49,799 --> 00:09:51,759
The rumors about the impending doom of the four families,

144
00:09:51,759 --> 00:09:53,000
I've already heard them.

145
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,879
After I help you gather the talismans and seal eyes?

146
00:09:55,519 --> 00:09:57,080
Are you going to become the head of the four families?

147
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:58,200
After that,

148
00:09:58,200 --> 00:10:00,240
I need to find a tomb that moves,

149
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:02,679
to settle a 20-year-old score.

150
00:10:02,879 --> 00:10:03,919
As for the rest,

151
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,159
Chief Leng,

152
00:10:05,519 --> 00:10:06,879
knowing too much

153
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:09,519
might get people coming after you, just like me.

154
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:11,960
Well, I'm coming after you right now.

155
00:10:12,279 --> 00:10:13,360
Zhang Tianyou.

156
00:10:13,679 --> 00:10:15,759
You're like a nesting doll.

157
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,080
Peel back one layer,

158
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:19,559
and there's another one inside.

159
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:20,960
Hey, no, stop peeling!

160
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:25,200
You're driving me crazy.

161
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:28,519
It's been a whole day and night.

162
00:10:28,519 --> 00:10:30,440
Leng Feiyan hasn't sent any news yet.

163
00:10:30,919 --> 00:10:32,240
Could she have failed?

164
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:34,240
Dealing with that piece of trash

165
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,960
shouldn't be hard for her, right?

166
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:40,360
Go to the Sheng Family and test the waters.

167
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:41,519
Me?

168
00:10:42,399 --> 00:10:44,720
Won't that attract too much attention?

169
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:46,639
If you don't go, should I?

170
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:48,360
Tiankun, don't forget

171
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:50,440
who's going to be in charge of the Qi Family.

172
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:52,279
Are you disobeying me already?

173
00:10:59,559 --> 00:11:01,120
Fine, I'll go.

174
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:10,000
Mother? What are you doing here?

175
00:11:10,039 --> 00:11:12,759
Tiankun, I heard everything just now.

176
00:11:13,399 --> 00:11:15,279
Though your brother's birth mother died early,

177
00:11:15,799 --> 00:11:17,559
he's still the legitimate son of the Qi Family.

178
00:11:17,879 --> 00:11:19,399
The situation is unusual right now.

179
00:11:19,759 --> 00:11:21,080
You must endure it if you can.

180
00:11:21,279 --> 00:11:22,080
Mm.

181
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:34,440
Boss, this is the place.

182
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,799
But this place is a bit sinister.

183
00:11:37,039 --> 00:11:38,720
It's the ominous "White Tiger Holding a Corpse" grave.

184
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:39,960
Doesn't seem like it's for hiding treasure.

185
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:42,159
More like it's suppressing something.

186
00:11:42,159 --> 00:11:45,320
It's interesting the Qi Family hid things in such a place.

187
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:47,759
Xiaomei, what about the thing I asked you to look into?

188
00:11:47,799 --> 00:11:51,480
Boss, publicly, Zhang Tianyou is the Sheng Family's live-in son-in-law.

189
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:53,559
Aside from his unique birth chart,

190
00:11:53,559 --> 00:11:55,320
said to block disasters and absorb evil,

191
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:57,799
his background is as clean as a blank slate.

192
00:11:58,399 --> 00:12:00,120
The cleaner it is, the more suspicious.

193
00:12:00,679 --> 00:12:01,679
Go send him a message.

194
00:12:01,879 --> 00:12:04,519
Tell him the goods are verified.

195
00:12:04,679 --> 00:12:06,639
Ask him to pick them up in person.

196
00:12:06,639 --> 00:12:07,480
Yes, understood.

197
00:12:27,759 --> 00:12:29,759
Your dragon dowsing rod points to this perilous tomb.

198
00:12:30,679 --> 00:12:31,399
Zhang Tianyou.

199
00:12:31,879 --> 00:12:34,320
You said the Qi Family hid the talisman book in a place like this.

200
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:36,519
Is it to ward off thieves or to brew poison?

201
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:41,440
Maybe it's both.

202
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:43,279
Deception masks the truth.

203
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:47,200
The most dangerous place often hides the most crucial key.

204
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:56,360
Alright.

205
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:58,279
I've brought you here.

206
00:12:59,799 --> 00:13:01,080
Our deal is done.

207
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:03,879
It's time you paid my reward.

208
00:13:07,639 --> 00:13:08,360
Of course.

209
00:13:08,559 --> 00:13:12,440
But removing deep-rooted corpse poison

210
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:14,279
requires using golden needles on your acupoints

211
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:15,960
to channel Yang energy into your body.

212
00:13:16,879 --> 00:13:19,519
The process, well, might be a bit awkward.

213
00:13:22,519 --> 00:13:24,919
All of you, get out. Guard the cave entrance.

214
00:13:24,919 --> 00:13:26,519
Don't let a single fly in.

215
00:13:26,519 --> 00:13:27,320
Yes, understood.

216
00:13:29,200 --> 00:13:30,000
Alright.

217
00:13:31,279 --> 00:13:33,879
Zhang Tianyou, show me your true skills.

218
00:13:34,039 --> 00:13:36,240
Don't just be all talk.

219
00:13:55,759 --> 00:13:56,759
Why are you just standing there?

220
00:13:56,759 --> 00:13:57,480
Come here!

221
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:58,240
Something's wrong.

222
00:13:58,240 --> 00:13:59,200
What's wrong?

223
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:03,759
The energy feels wrong.

224
00:14:05,919 --> 00:14:08,000
Yin energy, death aura...

225
00:14:08,159 --> 00:14:10,960
And a faint stirring of something alive.
